# Task 1 – Junior Security Analyst Journey

## 1. Main Concept

A SOC L1 / Junior Security Analyst is part of a security team that acts as the first line of defense against cyber threats.

## 2. Important Things to Remember

- Monitor and investigate security alerts.
- Work with other SOC analysts and teams.
- Escalate issues or take action according to procedures and permissions.
- Participate in security discussions/workshops.
- Continuously learn about new attacks and defenses.
- The SOC operates as a team, often 24/7.

## 3. What I Should Understand / Be Able to Do After This Task

Understand the basic role of a SOC L1 analyst and how to review alerts, investigate them, work with the team, follow procedures, and escalate when needed.